# ⚠️ Current Limitations

- Session-based memory is not persistent after restarting the application.
- Vector indexes are rebuilt when documents are re-uploaded.
- OCR is not implemented for image-based PDFs.
- Responses depend on the quality of extracted document text.
- Source citations are not displayed in generated responses.

